  "description": "The native payload for Agora's facial expression capture extension (full-face-capture 4.6.3 on Maven Central), packaged for .NET for Android. Tracks facial expression coefficients from the camera, for driving an avatar rather than sending the camera image itself. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Android or Net.Agora.Voice.Android — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is RtcEngine.RegisterFaceInfoObserver in the RTC binding.",
